Speaking of the killer minotaurs, the way I handle the situation is by always
genociding them (hopefully along with all other H's) before entering hell.
There is no way those wands of digging are useful enough to make up for
the risk.

Just won the third time this month, with a lv. 16, 75 hp wizard with +5 
Excalibur as his only weapon. The most fun I had was when I wished for a
blessed magic marker (which I almost always wish for), mass-produced some 
blessed genocide scrolls, and nailed any class of monsters that had 
gotten even the slightest bit on my nerves during the game. Highly satisfying.

